new file mode 100644
index 0000000..08aade1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/SERVICE_ICONS.md
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Built-in service icons
+
+The `ic_service_*.xml` vector drawables in
+`shared/src/commonMain/composeResources/drawable/` are derived from
+[Simple Icons](https://simpleicons.org/) (CC0 1.0), using versions 9, 12 and 16
+of the icon set.
+
+Brand names and logos are trademarks of their respective owners. They are
+included only to let you identify your own subscriptions and recurring
+expenses; this app is not affiliated with or endorsed by any of these
+companies.
